50
00:01:38.777 --> 00:01:40.250
"Sabrina."

51
00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.400
Ah, "Sabrina."

52
00:01:43.142 --> 00:01:47.010
Yeah, it was my first, you know, movie opportunity.

53
00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:49.722 line:15%
