59
00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:08.220
And I'm in that white tuxedo down by the shore

60
00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.780
trying to catch bluefish,

61
00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:12.956
and I finally landed one at the very moment

62
00:02:12.956 --> 00:02:14.620
'cause they were always waiting,

63
00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:16.800
