64
00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:19.270
this scaly, slithery beast in my hands,

65
00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:21.170
they're like, "Greg, we need you now."

66
00:02:22.225 --> 00:02:26.940
And I go up on the thing and covered in fish scales,

67
00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:29.628
