68
00:02:29.628 --> 00:02:30.461
but that was-

69
00:02:30.461 --> 00:02:31.520
Oh well.

70
00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:33.070
My best story from "Sabrina."

71
00:02:34.769 --> 00:02:39.260
Okay, your Oscar nominated role, "As Good as It Gets."

72
00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.520
Yeah, I remember going to the Oscars with,

73
00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.271 line:15%
