77
00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.767 line:15%
And I was like, "I don't know."

78
00:02:50.767 --> 00:02:53.840 line:15%
And then there was a limousine that pulled up,

79
00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.250 line:15%
