81
00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:01.473
I've ever seen.

82
00:03:01.473 --> 00:03:04.183
I think there was like a jacuzzi in the back of it.

83
00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.010
And I was like...

84
00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:09.420
And was bumping into like the garage

85
00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:12.030
