88
00:03:15.815 --> 00:03:18.286
I usher my wife, mom, and dad.

89
00:03:18.286 --> 00:03:21.180
My mom's like, "Oh look, there's a disco ball."

90
00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.840
And it was so mortifying

91
00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.210
