94
00:03:29.457 --> 00:03:30.690
(Drew laughing)

95
00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.300
'Cause life always throws those comedic curve balls.

96
00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:34.160
Yeah, I guess.

97
00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.606
