00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.120
Of course, by the time I was halfway through my coffee,

113
00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.170
I'm doing the movie.
She knows.

114
00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.246
Yes, because AKA spiderweb EAT.

115
00:04:08.246 --> 00:04:09.599
Exactly.

116
00:04:09.599 --> 00:04:11.033
WEB AKA EAT.

117
00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.464
DUH.

118
00:04:14.464 --> 00:04:16.080
Duh.

